  "id": "pr-262",
  "instruction": "Update glom's command-line interface (`glom.cli`) to safely parse YAML target inputs. When YAML data is supplied as a target (via CLI arguments, files, or stdin), glom CLI should use safe YAML loading (e.g., `yaml.safe_load`) rather than unsafe loader mechanisms. All existing CLI operations for querying and transforming YAML target data should continue to function properly and remain compatible with Python 3.10 and later.",
